OL,3,GNEWSACleverly accuses Burnham of 'war
OL,4,Aon London'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir James Cleverly, who resigned from
OL,7,Fthe shadow cabinet on Saturday to run
OL,8,Ffor Mayor of London, has accused the
OL,9,Fprime minister of waging a "war on
OL,10,FLondon" and pursuing a "very
OL,11,Fanti-London agenda".
OL,13,FThe senior Conservative claimed Andy
OL,14,FBurnham's devolution drive would come
OL,15,Fat the expense of London, arguing the
OL,16,Fplans centralised power in Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
