OL,3,GNEWSACleverly accuses Burnham of 'war
OL,4,Aon London'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, Sir James announced he was
OL,7,Fquitting the Tory front bench as shadow
OL,8,Fsecretary of state for housing,
OL,9,Fcommunities and local government to run
OL,10,Ffor City Hall at the next mayoral
OL,11,Felection in 2028.
OL,13,FA government spokesperson said
OL,14,Fdevolution plans would "deliver good
OL,15,Fgrowth in every postcode".
